  "caveats": [
    "A journal report and a registry posting are different data cuts of the same trial, taken at different dates, so exact agreement is not expected.",
    "The reporting thresholds differ, which changes which terms reach an axis. Aggregating by the maximum over terms rather than the sum limits but does not remove the effect.",
    "The registry's own numbers are not ground truth; they are a second measurement.",
    "A paper's column may pool doses the registry splits, or the reverse.",
    "Only the denominator check and the hard-failure counts isolate the extractor; every rate difference has at least two possible causes."
  ]
